# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# COMMIT MESSAGE FORMAT
# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# [optional body]
#
# [optional footer(s)]
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# TYPE (required) — choose one:
#   feat      New feature for the user
#   fix       Bug fix for the user
#   docs      Documentation changes only
#   style     Formatting, whitespace (no logic change)
#   refactor  Code restructure (no feature/fix)
#   perf      Performance improvements
#   test      Adding or updating tests
#   chore     Build, deps, tooling, config
#   ci        CI/CD pipeline changes
#   revert    Revert a previous commit
#   hotfix    Critical production fix
#
# SCOPE (optional) — the service or area affected:
#   auth | user | restaurant | food | booking | order | payment | review
#   search | location | notification | admin | analytics | api-gateway
#   web | mobile | shared | docker | k8s | ci | deps | config
#
# SUBJECT (required):
#   - Imperative mood: "add" not "added" or "adds"
#   - No period at end
#   - Max 72 characters
#   - Lowercase
#
# BODY (optional):
#   - Explain WHAT and WHY, not HOW
#   - Wrap at 100 characters
#   - Separate from subject with blank line
#
# FOOTER (optional):
#   BREAKING CHANGE: <description>   ← triggers major version bump
#   Closes #123                       ← auto-closes GitHub issue
#   Refs #456                         ← references issue
#   Co-authored-by: Name <email>      ← for pair programming
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# EXAMPLES:
#
#   feat(booking): add table availability check before confirmation
#
#   fix(auth): resolve IPv4/IPv6 MongoDB connection issue on Windows
#
#   feat(web): implement restaurant search with filters and sorting
#
#   refactor(shared): replace amqplib types to support v0.10 API
#
#   feat(booking): add pre-order items to booking flow
#
#   BREAKING CHANGE: BookingService.createBooking now requires restaurantName
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
